check_prices_fit_the_order_type: a LIMIT order with a price reference passes
Level 6: level must be a whole number from 1 to 5, which is as deep as the unified quote carries
Kind unknown: price_reference kind must be one of absolute, last, mid, vwap, bid_level, offer_level, marketable
Offset ticks 1.5: offset_ticks must be a whole number
Buffer not a number: buffer_percent must be a number
Tag with a space: tag must be 1 to 20 letters and digits
Disclosed above quantity: disclosed_quantity cannot be more than quantity
LIMIT without a price: a LIMIT order needs a price
